    "show_share": true,
    "description": "As part of the joint efforts by the Government of Pakistan and AKU's Institute for Global Health and Development to eradicate polio, Mr Asif Rahim, Additional Secretary Health for Polio and Coordinator, Emergency Operations Centre (EOC) Khyber Pakhtunkhwa (KP), chaired a meeting to discuss the installation of hand pumps in the southern districts of the province. The hand pumps will be installed as community-based incentives to encourage the uptake of Polio vaccine.",
